00:39:50,481 --> 00:39:54,480
sea lift force, which had gone into tremendous neglect.

530
00:39:54,481 --> 00:39:58,580
Sea lift was improved. Loading and unloading was modernized.

531
00:39:58,581 --> 00:40:00,243
aircraft were ordered.

532
00:40:00,244 --> 00:40:05,080
US Transcom took on the characteristics of an efficient company.

533
00:40:05,081 --> 00:40:07,800
It even refers to its clients as customers.

