00:42:36,121 --> 00:42:43,120
But the difference here is that these folks provide support for distinguished visitors, to include the President of the United States.

569
00:42:43,121 --> 00:42:48,260
Although the scope of the command extends beyond global conflicts,

570
00:42:49,260 --> 00:42:51,480
one of U.S. Transcom's chief responsibilities

571
00:42:51,481 --> 00:42:54,760
is to evaluate war plans from a logistical perspective.

572
00:42:54,761 --> 00:42:57,520
When a combatant commander puts together his plan

573
00:42:57,521 --> 00:42:59,560
to be able to operate in a theater,

