00:43:30,161 --> 00:43:43,189
So not only are we fixating on improving things now, we're also spearheading development of futuristic systems, investing in them with our talent, with our dollars, to

582
00:43:43,190 --> 00:43:45,920
ensure we stay on the cutting edge.

583
00:43:46,520 --> 00:43:50,660
Those investments include expanding and improving other military movers.

584
00:43:52,080 --> 00:43:57,740
Land vehicles, ships, and airplanes that have always been the backbone of any successful defense.

